# Deny by default: Claude Code adds new state directories over time, and this
# repo is shared. Anything not explicitly allowed below stays out.
/*
!.gitignore

# Config (no secrets — checked). settings.local.json is machine-specific.
!settings.json

# Skills authored here. skills/synced/ is managed by claude.ai sync.
!skills/
skills/synced/

# Day-plan state: small, and it is the user's own data (what is active, what
# has been snoozed or dismissed), so it should travel with the repo.
!day-plan/

# Durable memory notes only — NOT the .jsonl conversation transcripts, which
# contain customer and internal detail and run to tens of megabytes.
!projects/
projects/*/*
!projects/*/memory/
